# Vite loads `.env.local` last, so it overrides the checked-in
# `.env.development` defaults. It is the file a developer puts their own
# machine's VITE_COMPASS_CALLER_ID in (and a bearer, if they ever point the UI
# at a real authenticated door) — never tracked, so a live credential cannot be
# committed by accident.
.env.local
.env.*.local
